{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：03:15 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:08 2026-11-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:08 2026-11-02 HKT</p><img alt=\"佐敦私家車溶溶爛爛惹疑 警檢6萬元毒品 24歲男司機涉毒被捕\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/6a0f524f46b10a24ea8ba7a5edbbd3d9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_25_1__0.jpeg\"/><p>油麻地發生販毒案。西九龍總區衝鋒隊人員周一（2日）下午在彌敦道巡邏期間，發現一輛私家車形跡可疑，遂上前截查，並在車內檢獲約32克懷疑可卡因、44克懷疑「Happy粉」及67粒懷疑含有依托咪酯的煙彈，毒品總市值約6萬元。</p><p>姓蔡（24歲）男司機涉嫌販運危險藥物、未獲授權而取用運輸工具、無牌駕駛及駕駛時沒有第三者保險，現正被扣留調查。</p><img alt=\"現場為佐敦道與彌敦道交界。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7584f3e37491b4047b7715f3596322a5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_23.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉案私家車車頭有多處刮痕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/83efcabbad7641d1afd55a2ec42eeafb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方搜查涉案車輛，發現一批懷疑毒品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f1ae3f1812d7531a2e89a24377388af6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_26.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方搜查涉案車輛，發現一批懷疑毒品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/685dd6461df4bbb3546ab5f6c90ccfb7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_26_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"司機被捕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8b5af2a7b6b63c04c7d9ad005537c5c3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_24.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方搜出一批現金。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fab4936ec03d1696cc9c81e27676b3b7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_25.jpeg\"/><p>據現場所見，涉案銀色私家車車頭有多處刮痕，車頭蓋未能完全關上，需以膠紙固定。被捕男子其後黑布蒙頭，由警員帶上警車。案件交由油尖警區刑事調查隊第八隊跟進。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T19:28:59.875037+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T19:15:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T00:18:33.924940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T19:27:03.142589+00:00","content_hash":"2eec4e97781f6684a8c94afc52e45241bc300f03470d984d97842d2678c5a0da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}